Hubbs helped surround [[Dante's house]], under orders from DeFoe and [[Grier]] to retrieve [[Eathon Lambert's journal]] from [[Lok Lambert]], [[Cherit]] and [[Dante Vale]]. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}} Hubbs and her fellow Suits pursued the three along the rooftops of Venice but failed to stop them. {{Source|The Casterwill Client}}

At [[Road of Alchemists]], Hubbs invoked a [[Mindrone]] to fight Lok's [[Freelancer]] but it was defeated. She and [[Mr. Koskin]] both hit Lok with an [[Augerfrost]], rendering him unconscious. DeFoe order the group to retreat when Dante retrieved and invoked [[Metagolem]]. {{Source|Words of Truth, Heart of Lies}}

Hubbs later attacked [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] with [[Mr. Koskin]] and [[Unnamed Suit 004]] at a burger restaurant where the Huntik team were trying earn enough to travel to [[Egypt]]. Hubbs was defeated when [[Santiago]] used her to shield himself from a [[Raypulse]] attack from one of Hubbs' colleagues. {{Source|All Work and No Pay}}
